\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (typed function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (canonical quotient-topology predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8QuotientTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8QuotientTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8QuotientTopology}_S(\\sigma,q,X,\\tau,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(q,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(q)=Y\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\sigma,q,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8QuotientTopology}_S(\\sigma,q,X,\\tau,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(q,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(q)=Y\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\sigma,q,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The map is explicitly surjective onto <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> is the final topology detected by preimages under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[A